    description 'Discard these choies:
/configuration/vrf/vrf-instances/vrf-inst/added-property/srv6-end-dt-sid
/configuration/vrf/vrf-instances/vrf-inst/address-family-ipv4/srv6-end-dt-sid
/configuration/vrf/vrf-instances/vrf-inst/address-family-ipv4/srv6-end-dx-sid
/configuration/vrf/vrf-instances/vrf-inst/address-family-ipv6/srv6-end-dt-sid
